  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through GENDER EQUALITY in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GENDER EQUALITY will ensure equal power relations between men and women in the community. Young women and men aged 15-30 will be mobilsed in peacemaker groups, and receive training on Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights and Transformative Masculinity. Through the trainings, they will be able to participate in, contribute to and benefit from social  development. Through Safe spaces the young women will be able to share their own challenges and experiences in a supportive environment.</narrative>
  </description>
